{"text": "Subj: Re:Hypnotism and >\nDate: 96-02-26 21:28:39 EST 2084073510\nFrom: DJBrush\n\nDid the hypnotism thing with my friend ten years ago exactly, she was really\ndy and it worked for hex, I'm still quitting for at least the Sth time\nce then. The patch may give you nicotine, but not all the other nasty\nvtuf\u00e9 and it really helps you through the habit part. Then you still have the\nnicotine withdrawal when you finally eliminate the smallest dose of the patch,\nbut it's still the only way I have even come close to quitting. If it were\nonly possible to eliminate all stress and be thoroughly entertained during all\nwaking hours for about a year, this wouldn't be so darn hard! Good Luck!\n\n3-19-1996 America Online: RGLING Page i", "words": [{"text": "Subj:", "x0": 41, "y0": 79, "x1": 71, "y1": 90, "conf": 55.0}, {"text": "Re:Hypnotism", "x0": 98, "y0": 79, "x1": 197, "y1": 90, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "and", "x0": 205, "y0": 79, "x1": 229, "y1": 88, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": ">", "x0": 578, "y0": 81, "x1": 581, "y1": 82, "conf": 31.0}, {"text": "Date:", "x0": 41, "y0": 93, "x1": 79, "y1": 102, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "96-02-26", "x0": 99, "y0": 93, "x1": 163, "y1": 102, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "21:28:39", "x0": 173, "y0": 93, "x1": 237, "y1": 102, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "EST", "x0": 247, "y0": 94, "x1": 270, "y1": 102, "conf": 80.0}, {"text": "2084073510", "x0": 507, "y0": 86, "x1": 597, "y1": 102, "conf": 86.0}, {"text": "From:", "x0": 42, "y0": 107, "x1": 79, "y1": 117, "conf": 73.0}, {"text": "DJBrush", "x0": 99, "y0": 107, "x1": 155, "y1": 117, "conf": 74.0}, {"text": "Did", "x0": 42, "y0": 136, "x1": 66, "y1": 145, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "the", "x0": 75, "y0": 136, "x1": 98, "y1": 145, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "hypnotism", "x0": 108, "y0": 136, "x1": 181, "y1": 148, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "thing", "x0": 190, "y0": 136, "x1": 229, "y1": 148, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "with", "x0": 239, "y0": 136, "x1": 271, "y1": 146, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "my", "x0": 